    "updated_at": "2021-09-22T17:18:47Z",
    "body": "We could add this for ShadowRealms, or we could just add `[Exposed=ShadowRealm]`. The choice depends on whether we want to go around adding lots of things to Worklets which are not currently exposed, and which we might decide to expose on ShadowRealm. In offline conversations with different HTML editors, I heard mixed opinions on this question, cc @domenic @annevk . Given that, I thought that it might be better to start with the more conservative approach of just adding things specifically to ShadowRealm.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
